{"parse": {"title": "翡冷翠合约", "pageid": 114923, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"preamble\">\n    <div class=\"preamble-background\"></div>\n    <div class=\"preamble-content\"><p>为了自由，我们化身黑暗中的刀刃。</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"infopad\" style=\"border-color:#ec5d00; background-color: #00000050;\"><b>活动时间</b>：2025/08/07 版本更新后 - 08/28 04:59 <br /> <b>开启条件：</b>通关主线故事<a href=\"/wiki/1ST-16\" title=\"1ST-16\">1ST-16</a> </div>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_title.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"翡冷翠合约 title.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_title.png/240px-%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_title.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"132\" class=\"hide-m\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_title.png/360px-%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_title.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_title.png/480px-%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_title.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"688\" data-file-height=\"379\" /></a></div>\n<p>协助刺客组织，根据对手的「武器」和「行动点」，选择己方「武器」和「行动点」，利用优势（选用有克制能力的武器与行动点）完成刺杀行动。参照结果获得奖励。\n</p>\n\n<h2><span id=\".E5.9C.BA.E6.99.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"场景\">场景</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\".E5.9C.BA.E6.99.AF.E4.B8.80.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"场景一览\">场景一览</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>隶属</th>\n<th>克制</th>\n<th>印象\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_changjing_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon changjing 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Icon_changjing_1.png/120px-Icon_changjing_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Icon_changjing_1.png/180px-Icon_changjing_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Icon_changjing_1.png/240px-Icon_changjing_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>交错屋顶</b></span></td>\n<td>街巷角落</td>\n<td>大型建筑</td>\n<td>空中的捷径，刺客的游廊\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_changjing_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon changjing 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Icon_changjing_2.png/120px-Icon_changjing_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Icon_changjing_2.png/180px-Icon_changjing_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Icon_changjing_2.png/240px-Icon_changjing_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>地下暗道</b></span></td>\n<td>街巷角落</td>\n<td>大型建筑</td>\n<td>感谢这座城市的消化系统\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_changjing_3.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon changjing 3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Icon_changjing_3.png/120px-Icon_changjing_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Icon_changjing_3.png/180px-Icon_changjing_3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Icon_changjing_3.png/240px-Icon_changjing_3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>逼仄小巷</b></span></td>\n<td>街巷角落</td>\n<td>大型建筑</td>\n<td>黑暗之中，隐藏着无数双眼睛\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_changjing_4.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon changjing 4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Icon_changjing_4.png/120px-Icon_changjing_4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Icon_changjing_4.png/180px-Icon_changjing_4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Icon_changjing_4.png/240px-Icon_changjing_4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>香料摊位</b></span></td>\n<td>纷乱集市</td>\n<td>小型地点</td>\n<td>色香味俱全的香料炸弹，拦住追击者的小妙招\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_changjing_5.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon changjing 5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Icon_changjing_5.png/120px-Icon_changjing_5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Icon_changjing_5.png/180px-Icon_changjing_5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Icon_changjing_5.png/240px-Icon_changjing_5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>市井喷泉</b></span></td>\n<td>纷乱集市</td>\n<td>小型地点</td>\n<td>虹彩四溅的水流足以迷惑每个人的视线\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_changjing_6.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon changjing 6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Icon_changjing_6.png/120px-Icon_changjing_6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Icon_changjing_6.png/180px-Icon_changjing_6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Icon_changjing_6.png/240px-Icon_changjing_6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>干草车</b></span></td>\n<td>纷乱集市</td>\n<td>小型地点</td>\n<td>温暖、柔软而熟悉的怀抱\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_changjing_7.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon changjing 7.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Icon_changjing_7.png/120px-Icon_changjing_7.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Icon_changjing_7.png/180px-Icon_changjing_7.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Icon_changjing_7.png/240px-Icon_changjing_7.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>驻军内庭</b></span></td>\n<td>坚实堡垒</td>\n<td>集会型地点</td>\n<td>有足够多的敌人，但也有足够的空间挥舞你的剑\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_changjing_8.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon changjing 8.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Icon_changjing_8.png/120px-Icon_changjing_8.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Icon_changjing_8.png/180px-Icon_changjing_8.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Icon_changjing_8.png/240px-Icon_changjing_8.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>哨塔</b></span></td>\n<td>坚实堡垒</td>\n<td>集会型地点</td>\n<td>弓箭手的眼睛片刻不离，你知道该怎么做\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_changjing_9.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon changjing 9.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Icon_changjing_9.png/120px-Icon_changjing_9.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Icon_changjing_9.png/180px-Icon_changjing_9.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Icon_changjing_9.png/240px-Icon_changjing_9.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>砖石高墙</b></span></td>\n<td>坚实堡垒</td>\n<td>集会型地点</td>\n<td>易守难攻之所\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span id=\".E5.85.8B.E5.88.B6.E5.85.B3.E7.B3.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"克制关系\">克制关系</span></h3>\n<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><img alt=\"翡冷翠合约 场景克制.webp\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E5%85%8B%E5%88%B6.webp/1024px-%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E5%85%8B%E5%88%B6.webp.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"396\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E5%85%8B%E5%88%B6.webp/1536px-%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E5%85%8B%E5%88%B6.webp.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E5%85%8B%E5%88%B6.webp/2048px-%E7%BF%A1%E5%86%B7%E7%BF%A0%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6_%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E5%85%8B%E5%88%B6.webp.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"4789\" data-file-height=\"1851\" /></div></div>\n<h2><span id=\".E6.AD.A6.E5.99.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"武器\">武器</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\".E6.AD.A6.E5.99.A8.E4.B8.80.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"武器一览\">武器一览</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>隶属 / 效果</th>\n<th>印象\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_wuqi_5.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon wuqi 5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/Icon_wuqi_5.png/120px-Icon_wuqi_5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/Icon_wuqi_5.png/180px-Icon_wuqi_5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/Icon_wuqi_5.png/240px-Icon_wuqi_5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米兰剑</b></span></td>\n<td>属于【中型武器】</td>\n<td>值得欣赏的不仅仅是那优雅卷曲的护手\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_wuqi_4.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon wuqi 4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Icon_wuqi_4.png/120px-Icon_wuqi_4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Icon_wuqi_4.png/180px-Icon_wuqi_4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Icon_wuqi_4.png/240px-Icon_wuqi_4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>佛罗伦萨弯刀</b></span></td>\n<td>属于【中型武器】</td>\n<td>飘逸而轻巧，配重合理\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_wuqi_7.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon wuqi 7.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/Icon_wuqi_7.png/120px-Icon_wuqi_7.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/Icon_wuqi_7.png/180px-Icon_wuqi_7.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/Icon_wuqi_7.png/240px-Icon_wuqi_7.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>卡瓦里里钉头锤</b></span></td>\n<td>属于【重型武器】</td>\n<td>谁都能听懂这份道理\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_wuqi_6.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon wuqi 6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Icon_wuqi_6.png/120px-Icon_wuqi_6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Icon_wuqi_6.png/180px-Icon_wuqi_6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Icon_wuqi_6.png/240px-Icon_wuqi_6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>凸缘钉头锤</b></span></td>\n<td>属于【重型武器】</td>\n<td>一次用力，多重伤痕\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_wuqi_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon wuqi 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/Icon_wuqi_2.png/120px-Icon_wuqi_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/Icon_wuqi_2.png/180px-Icon_wuqi_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/Icon_wuqi_2.png/240px-Icon_wuqi_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>有沟五指剑 </b></span></td>\n<td>属于【短武器】</td>\n<td>锋锐，敏捷，不易愈合\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_wuqi_3.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon wuqi 3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Icon_wuqi_3.png/120px-Icon_wuqi_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Icon_wuqi_3.png/180px-Icon_wuqi_3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Icon_wuqi_3.png/240px-Icon_wuqi_3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a> <br /> <span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>屠刀</b></span></td>\n<td>属于【短武器】</td>\n<td>简单就是好\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Icon_wuqi_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Icon wuqi 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/Icon_wuqi_1.png/120px-Icon_wuqi_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"98\" srcse